  "ruleText": "PART He-P 2312 POULTRY PRODUCERS AND RABBIT PRODUCERS SELLING POULTRY AND RABBITS TO RESTAURANTS LICENSED UNDER RSA 143-A\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #12852, effective 8-20-19, readopted, readopted with amendment, or repealed existing rules in Chapter He-P 2300. The rules repealed were Part He-P 2312 titled “Out of State Food Producers in Residential, Non-Commercial Kitchens”, containing He-P 2312.01 titled “Registration of Out-of-State Producers in Residential, Non-Commercial Kitchens.” Document #12852 also readopted with amendment and renumbered Part He-P 2313 and Part He-P 2314 as Part He-P 2312 and Part He-P 2313, respectively.\n\nDocument #12852 replaces all prior filings affecting the rules in Chapter He-P 2300. The prior filings affecting the repealed Part He-P 2312 included the following documents:\n\n#2802, effective 8-8-84, EXPIRED 8-8-90\n\n#5051, effective 1-22-91, EXPIRED 1-22-97\n\n#6503, INTERIM, effective 4-25-97, EXPIRED 8-23-97\n\n#6722, effective 3-27-98\n\n#7893, effective 5-21-03\n\n#9857-A, effective 2-1-11, EXPIRED 2-1-19\n\n#9857-B, effective 2-1-11\n\n#10867, effective 6-25-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2300.html"
